APT35 credential reuse across changing IPs.

IdentityLogonEvents
| where ActionType == "LogonSuccess"
| sort by AccountUpn, Timestamp asc
| extend PrevTime = prev(Timestamp),
         PrevIP = prev(IPAddress)
| extend TimeDiff = datetime_diff("minute", Timestamp, PrevTime)
| where TimeDiff between (1 .. 180)
| where IPAddress != PrevIP
| project AccountUpn, IPAddress, PrevIP, Timestamp
